<http://llod.jerteh.rs/alo/alo.owl> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/abstract> "The ontology of abusive speech is designed for publishing results of the abusive language annotation process in a structured form. The goal is to have a placeholder for different dataset formats, to support diverse abusive language detection methodologies and content providers."@en .
