<http://llod.jerteh.rs/alo/alo.owl#Ableism> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Ableism is discrimination and social prejudice against people with disabilities based on the belief that typical abilities (those of non-disabled people) are superior. It is a system of beliefs, practices, and societal structures that devalues and discriminates against people with physical, intellectual, sensory, mental, or developmental disabilities."@en .
<http://llod.jerteh.rs/alo/alo.owl#Ableism> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Ableism"@en .
