<http://llod.jerteh.rs/alo/alo.owl#AbuseCategory> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Abusive language is hurtful language that a speaker uses to insult or offend another individual or a group of individuals based on their personal qualities, appearance, social status, opinions, statements, or actions (Casseli, 2020)."@en .
<http://llod.jerteh.rs/alo/alo.owl#AbuseCategory> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "AbuseCategory"@en .
