<http://llod.jerteh.rs/alo/alo.owl#Homophobia> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Homophobia is the fear, hatred, discomfort, prejudice, discrimination, or aversion directed towards homosexual people (gay men and lesbians) or homosexuality itself."@en .
