<http://llod.jerteh.rs/alo/alo.owl#Immigrant> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Represents real or perceived immigrant status as the characteristic on the basis of which an individual or group is targeted by abusive speech."@en .
