<http://llod.jerteh.rs/alo/alo.owl#Incitement> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Represents a characteristic of abusive speech that encourages, advocates, or calls for harmful actions, such as discrimination, segregation, or violence, against an individual or group."@en .
<http://llod.jerteh.rs/alo/alo.owl#Incitement> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The aim of abusive speech."@en .
<http://llod.jerteh.rs/alo/alo.owl#Incitement> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Incitement"@en .
# 
# http://llod.jerteh.rs/alo/alo.owl#Insult
<http://llod.jerteh.rs/alo/alo.owl#Insult> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
