<http://llod.jerteh.rs/alo/alo.owl#Insult> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Represents the intention to insult, demean, or humiliate an individual or group through abusive language."@en .
<http://llod.jerteh.rs/alo/alo.owl#Insult> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Insult"@en .
# 
# http://llod.jerteh.rs/alo/alo.owl#Intelligence
