<http://llod.jerteh.rs/alo/alo.owl#Intention> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Represents the communicative purpose or intended effect of abusive speech, describing what the speaker aims to achieve through the abusive expression."@en .
<http://llod.jerteh.rs/alo/alo.owl#Intention> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Intention"@en .
