<http://llod.jerteh.rs/alo/alo.owl#LexicalSourceConcept> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Represents the semantic domain of an abusive lexical expression, corresponding to the conceptual category from which the expression originates (e.g., animals, plants, professions, or diseases)."@en .
<http://llod.jerteh.rs/alo/alo.owl#LexicalSourceConcept> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "LexicalSourceConcept"@en .
# 
