<http://llod.jerteh.rs/alo/alo.owl#LexicalUnit> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Represents a classification of lexical entries according to their lexical realization or conventional linguistic form, such as a single word, multiword expression, idiom, catchphrase, proverb, or similar lexical unit types."@en .
