<http://llod.jerteh.rs/alo/alo.owl#Lookism> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Lookism refers to prejudice or discrimination based on physical appearance and especially physical appearance believed to fall short of societal notions of beauty."@en .
