<http://llod.jerteh.rs/alo/alo.owl#MaleGenitalia> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Represents the semantic domain of male genital anatomy, encompassing abusive lexical expressions derived from or referring to male genital concepts."@en .
