# http://llod.jerteh.rs/alo/alo.owl#Malediction
<http://llod.jerteh.rs/alo/alo.owl#Malediction> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<http://llod.jerteh.rs/alo/alo.owl#Malediction> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://llod.jerteh.rs/alo/alo.owl#AbuseCategory> .
<http://llod.jerteh.rs/alo/alo.owl#Malediction> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Kletva je svečana izjava, želja ili prizivanje natprirodne sile sa namerom da se nekome ili nečemu nanese zlo, kazna ili nesreća; čin proklinjanja. Ovo odgovara engleskom značenju \"invocation of harm / malediction\". (\"Dabogda crk'o\" je primer kletve)."@sr .
<http://llod.jerteh.rs/alo/alo.owl#Malediction> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Malediction (curse) is a solemn utterance or expressed wish intended to invoke a supernatural power to inflict harm, punishment, evil, or misfortune upon someone or something."@en .
<http://llod.jerteh.rs/alo/alo.owl#Malediction> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Malediction"@en .
# 
# http://llod.jerteh.rs/alo/alo.owl#Man
<http://llod.jerteh.rs/alo/alo.owl#Man> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<http://llod.jerteh.rs/alo/alo.owl#Man> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://llod.jerteh.rs/alo/alo.owl#Gender> .
<http://llod.jerteh.rs/alo/alo.owl#Man> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#disjointWith> <http://llod.jerteh.rs/alo/alo.owl#Woman> .
<http://llod.jerteh.rs/alo/alo.owl#Man> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Represents men as the target of abusive speech based on their gender."@en .
<http://llod.jerteh.rs/alo/alo.owl#Man> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Man"@en .
# 
