<http://llod.jerteh.rs/alo/alo.owl#Metaphor> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://llod.jerteh.rs/alo/alo.owl#RhetoricalFigure> .
<http://llod.jerteh.rs/alo/alo.owl#Metaphor> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Represents a rhetorical figure in which a word or expression is used to refer to something to which it is not literally applicable, based on an implicit comparison."@en .
<http://llod.jerteh.rs/alo/alo.owl#Metaphor> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Metaphor"@en .
# 
# http://llod.jerteh.rs/alo/alo.owl#Misandry
