_:genid58 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Restriction> .
<http://llod.jerteh.rs/alo/alo.owl#Misandry> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Misandry is the dislike of, contempt for, ingrained prejudice against, or hatred of men and boys. It is the parallel concept to misogyny."@en .
<http://llod.jerteh.rs/alo/alo.owl#Misandry> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Misandry"@en .
# 
# http://llod.jerteh.rs/alo/alo.owl#Misogyny
<http://llod.jerteh.rs/alo/alo.owl#Misogyny> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<http://llod.jerteh.rs/alo/alo.owl#Misogyny> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://llod.jerteh.rs/alo/alo.owl#Sexism> .
<http://llod.jerteh.rs/alo/alo.owl#Misogyny> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> _:genid59 .
_:genid59 <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#someValuesFrom> <http://llod.jerteh.rs/alo/alo.owl#Woman> .
_:genid59 <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#onProperty> <http://llod.jerteh.rs/alo/alo.owl#isDirectedAgainst> .
_:genid59 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Restriction> .
<http://llod.jerteh.rs/alo/alo.owl#Misogyny> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Misogyny is the dislike of, contempt for, ingrained prejudice against, or hatred of women and girls. It is a specific form of sexism characterized by a hostile and often demeaning attitude towards women."@en .
<http://llod.jerteh.rs/alo/alo.owl#Misogyny> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Misogyny"@en .
# 
# http://llod.jerteh.rs/alo/alo.owl#Muslim
