<http://llod.jerteh.rs/alo/alo.owl#Muslim> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://llod.jerteh.rs/alo/alo.owl#ReligiousBeliefs> .
<http://llod.jerteh.rs/alo/alo.owl#Muslim> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Represents Muslim affiliation as the basis for abusive speech directed toward an individual or group."@en .
<http://llod.jerteh.rs/alo/alo.owl#Muslim> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Muslim"@en .
